cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Holdout, please cite it as below."
title: "Holdout: a self-auditing data-science agent for tabular CSVs"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Rohit Kumar
    family-names: Yadav
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-20
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/iamrohitkumaryadav9/holdout"
keywords:
  - data leakage
  - data science agents
  - model evaluation
  - LLM agents
abstract: >-
  Holdout seals the holdout set before anything computes a feature-target statistic,
  compiles typed modelling plans into leakage-safe pipelines, audits them with twelve
  deterministic checks, and allows one logged holdout evaluation. Version 1.0.0 was
  evaluated on a pre-registered benchmark; 1.1.0 adds post-hoc fixes evaluated as
  exploratory.
